			<mn>2</mn>
			<mi>a</mi>
		</mrow>
		<mo>+</mo>
		<mn>6</mn>
	</mrow>
	<mo>=</mo>
	<mrow>
		<mo>-</mo>
		<mn>22</mn>
	</mrow>
</mrow>
</math>. Subtracting <math alttext="6"><mn>6</mn>
</math> from both sides of this equation yields <math alttext="minus 2 a equals negative 28"><mrow>
	<mrow>
		<mo>-</mo>
		<mn>2</mn>
		<mi>a</mi>
	</mrow>
	<mo>=</mo>
	<mrow>
		<mo>-</mo>
		<mn>28</mn>
