 src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/1ecaa9c0/img_004_db6ca14e.png" alt="0 point 7 0 times 38 "></span> gives <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/1ecaa9c0/img_005_58e95bbb.png" alt="c equals, 20 point 0 0 plus 26 point 6 0"></span>. Adding these values gives <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/1ecaa9c0/img_006_a5e1174d.png" alt="c equals 46 point 6 0"></span>, so the total amount Robert was charged is $46.60.<p>Choices B, C, and D are incorrect and may result from setting up the equation incorrectly or from making calculation errors.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></p>
