</math> for <math alttext="x"><mi>x</mi>
</math> in the given equation yields <math alttext="y equals 70 left parenthesis 4 right parenthesis plus 8"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>70</mn><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></math>, or <math alttext="y equals 288"><mrow>
