</math> is a linear function, it can be defined by an equation of the form&nbsp;<math alttext="f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals a x plus b"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math>, where <math alttext="a"><mi>a</mi>
