$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"a","content":"<p class=\"choice_paragraph \"><span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/2704399f/img_000_972dc949.png\" alt=\"Equation 1: y equals 0. Equation 2: x equals three halves\"></span></p>\n"},{"id":"b","content":"<p class=\"choice_paragraph \"><span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/2704399f/img_001_c62c347c.png\" alt=\"Equation 1:  y equals three halves. Equation 2: x equals 0\"></span></p>\n"},{"id":"c","content":"<p class=\"choice_paragraph \"><span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/2704399f/img_002_f736bf83.png\" alt=\"Equation 1: y equals 0. Equation 2: x equals 1\"></span></p>\n"},{"id":"d","content":"<p class=\"choice_paragraph \"><span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/2704399f/img_003_3c425e41.png\" alt=\"Equation 1: y equals 1. Equation 2: x equals 0\"></span></p>\n"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["A"]$SATQ$::jsonb, NULL, $SATQ$<p>Choice A is correct. The solution to a system of equations is the coordinates of the intersection point of the graphs of the equations in the <span class="italic">xy</span>-plane. Based on the graph, the solution to the given system of equations is best approximated as <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/2704399f/img_005_1839aadc.png" alt="the point with coordinates three halves comma 0"></span>. In the <span class="italic">xy</span>-plane, the graph of <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/2704399f/img_006_eedaaf46.png" alt="y equals 0"></span> is a horizontal line on which every <span class="italic">y</span>-coordinate is 0, and the graph of <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/2704399f/img_007_daa5f45d.png" alt="x equals three halves"></span> is a vertical line on which every <span class="italic">x</span>-coordinate is <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/2704399f/img_008_468d73a8.png" alt="three halves"></span>. These graphs intersect at the point <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/2704399f/img_009_1839aadc.png" alt="with coordinates three halves comma 0"></span>. Therefore, the system of equations in choice A has the same solution as the given system.<p>Choices B, C, and D are incorrect. If graphed in the<span class="italic"> xy</span>-plane, these choices would intersect at the points <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/2704399f/img_010_20d629cd.png" alt="with coordinates 0 comma three halves"></span>, <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/2704399f/img_011_8deb0015.png" alt="1 comma 0"></span>, and <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/2704399f/img_012_ac0cebd7.png" alt="0 comma 1"></span>, respectively, not <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/2704399f/img_013_1839aadc.png" alt="the point with coordinates three halves comma 0"></span>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></p>
